              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kufuma Amazia wasigha kumnugha BWANA, wandu weremdedieghe njama Jerusalemu, nao ukakimbia cha Lakishi. Ela wandu wikadumwa wimnughe cha Lakishi, nawo wikaghenda wikam'bwaghia aho. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.25.27",
